<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ABC Rail Products cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ABC Rail Products cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Werthiem &amp; Co said it downgraded ABC Rail Products Corp to &quot;perform in line&quot; from &quot;outperform.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ABC Rail lost 1-7/16 to 16-3/4 at midday.</p>
</text>
